# "Any effect that causes an object to lose hexproof will cause an object to lose all 'hexproof from [quality]'
# abilities" (CR 702.11e; Knight of Grace's ruling). Bot2's Fatal Push can't target Knight of Grace (hexproof from
# black) on turn 2. On turn 4 Bot2's Shadowspear makes the permanents Bot1 controls lose hexproof until end of turn,
# and the same Fatal Push then destroys the Knight.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Knight of Grace
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Shadowspear
Fatal Push
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

