Bot2.Hand.Shadowspear.Cast
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Hand.Fatal Push.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Knight of Grace)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Shadowspear.Activate(Ability: lose hexproof)
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Knight of Grace.HexproofFrom = (absent)
Bot2.Hand.Fatal Push.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Knight of Grace)
Bot2.Pass

